      "side": 1,
      "message": "`inner + count` here, and `inner + more` a few lines down, overflow when an ellipsis count comes from the artifact. With the outer count of `((a ...) ...)` set to `u64::MAX`, debug and test builds panicked with \"attempt to add with overflow\" on the expander thread, outside any native catch. Release builds wrap and report a macro error instead. Bounding counts at decode (artifact.rs) fixes it. `checked_add` here would make it independent of that.",
      "revId": "060ee05cbaf46b808397560b4cf19185d2be80b2",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
